title: Famine on the Volga
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and c_famine_timer <= 0 and ((year = 1921 and month >= 8) or (year = 1922 and month <= 9))
on-arrival: c_famine_timer = 5; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: international

= Famine on the Volga

Drought, war and requisitions have brought famine to the Volga. Millions are starving; there are reports of cannibalism in Samara. Lenin has appealed to the workers of the world, and Willi Münzenberg has founded the Workers' International Relief in Berlin to answer him. [? if c_famine_relief = 1 : Our collections have already sent several shiploads of food. ?]

Even the SPD's workers want to help. The question is how.

- @collect: Collect in every factory, with any worker who will give.
- @party_funds: Send the party's own money.
- @skilled: Send skilled workers and machines.
- @easy_discard

@collect
subtitle: A broad campaign alongside the social democratic workers. Worker support and goodwill rise.
on-arrival: {!
Q.c_famine_relief = 1;
Q.worker_support += 3;
Q.spd_relation += 3;
if (Q.uspd_exists) {
    Q.uspd_relation += 3;
}
Q.world_revolution += 2;
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 2;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

Collection tins pass through every works canteen in Germany. Workers who would never vote for us give a day's wages for the Russian children.

@party_funds
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Moscow is grateful; the party is poorer.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; c_famine_relief = 1; world_revolution += 3; independence += 2; offensive_satisfaction += 2

The party's own money buys grain in Hamburg. For once, the money is going east.

@skilled
subtitle: Some of our best workers emigrate. Soviet industry gains; our districts lose them.
on-arrival: {!
Q.c_famine_relief = 1;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 0.99;
}
Q.world_revolution += 4;
Q.independence -= 2;
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 2;
!}

Engineers from the Ruhr and toolmakers from Berlin pack their tools for the Urals. Some will build a new world. Some will write home to say it is harder than they thought.
